{"id":1325,"title":"HTML介绍 ","summary":"HTML介绍 ","tags":"","components":[{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1e6a520b-31ef-33a0-b4a1-da3124c77ce5","title":"HTML结构","question_id":2934,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"question_id":2934,"title":"HTML结构","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f60ab9b0-4410-3760-9891-08f5522eaf26","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们已经知道如何借助浏览器审查一个网页的元素，并且知道了网页是有标签和样式的内容。接下来，我们深入解析下网页标签结构。\n\n先看一个例子，下面是豆瓣某本书的html部分源码:\n\n全部源码可以访问[这个链接](https://book.douban.com/subject/35069491/?icn=index-latestbook-subject)","text_html":"<p>我们已经知道如何借助浏览器审查一个网页的元素，并且知道了网页是有标签和样式的内容。接下来，我们深入解析下网页标签结构。</p>\n<p>先看一个例子，下面是豆瓣某本书的html部分源码:</p>\n<p>全部源码可以访问<a href=\"https://book.douban.com/subject/35069491/?icn=index-latestbook-subject\">这个链接</a></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6bf2dad0-24aa-38f6-87e3-3825d60e4418","title":"","caption":"","language":"html","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"<html>\n    <head>\n    <link href=\"/content/dependencies/douban.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"indent \">\n          \n            <div class=\"\">\n            <style type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">\n.intro p{text-indent:2em;word-break:normal;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"intro\">\n    <p>阿瑟•米勒（1915-2005）</p>    <p>美国当代最杰出的戏剧家之一，与尤金•奥尼尔、田纳西•威廉斯并称为二十世纪美国戏剧三大家，被誉为 “美国戏剧的良心”。著有《推销员之死》《萨勒姆的女巫》《都是我的儿子》《桥头眺望》《堕落之后》《代价》《美国时钟》等多部戏剧。他的作品针砭时弊、直言不讳。米勒一生获奖无数，包括1949年普利策奖、两次纽约戏剧评论奖、奥利弗最佳戏剧奖等。</p></div>\n\n            </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"source_content":"<html>\n    <head>\n    <link href=\"https://img3.doubanio.com/f/book/e87e3a06f234a06e09ded94a5855bc6f50390ccd/css/book/master.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"indent \">\n          \n            <div class=\"\">\n            <style type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">\n.intro p{text-indent:2em;word-break:normal;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"intro\">\n    <p>阿瑟•米勒（1915-2005）</p>    <p>美国当代最杰出的戏剧家之一，与尤金•奥尼尔、田纳西•威廉斯并称为二十世纪美国戏剧三大家，被誉为 “美国戏剧的良心”。著有《推销员之死》《萨勒姆的女巫》《都是我的儿子》《桥头眺望》《堕落之后》《代价》《美国时钟》等多部戏剧。他的作品针砭时弊、直言不讳。米勒一生获奖无数，包括1949年普利策奖、两次纽约戏剧评论奖、奥利弗最佳戏剧奖等。</p></div>\n\n            </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"72262d93-d237-3826-b459-374a5d87d77f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"查看一个网页的源码的步骤我们在第一节的部分已经讲过了，具体操作可以看下面的这个视频:\n<video src=\"/api/media/fc016e52f3a60c386a00\"   controls=\"controls\"></video> \n\n现在我们正式介绍下网页HTML，网页一般由三部分组成，分别\n- HTML（超文本标记语言）\n- CSS（层叠样式表）\n- JavaScript（活动脚本语言）","text_html":"<p>查看一个网页的源码的步骤我们在第一节的部分已经讲过了，具体操作可以看下面的这个视频:\n<video src=\"/api/media/fc016e52f3a60c386a00\"   controls=\"controls\"></video></p>\n<p>现在我们正式介绍下网页HTML，网页一般由三部分组成，分别</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTML（超文本标记语言）</li>\n<li>CSS（层叠样式表）</li>\n<li>JavaScript（活动脚本语言）</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪一项不是网页的组成部分:","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪一项不是网页的组成部分:</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":10340,"key":"A","text":"TEXT","text_html":"<p>TEXT</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10341,"key":"B","text":"HMTL","text_html":"<p>HMTL</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10342,"key":"C","text":"CSS","text_html":"<p>CSS</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10343,"key":"D","text":"JavaScript","text_html":"<p>JavaScript</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"190ef9ca-7bae-31dd-8e41-bd5617bbc957","title":"HTMl标签","question_id":2935,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"question_id":2935,"title":"HTMl标签","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a8d2839b-52c6-3a10-ba60-642a6672d69b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"HTML 是整个网页的结构，相当于整个网站的框架。带`<`、`>`符号的都属于 HTML 的标签，并且标签都是成对出现的。\n\n常见的标签如下。","text_html":"<p>HTML 是整个网页的结构，相当于整个网站的框架。带<code>&lt;</code>、<code>&gt;</code>符号的都属于 HTML 的标签，并且标签都是成对出现的。</p>\n<p>常见的标签如下。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"719b4c06-b77f-3c68-ad7f-7a9452ee89f2","title":"","caption":"","language":"html","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"<html>...</html>    # 表示标记中间的元素是网页\n<body>...</body>    # 表示用户可见的内容\n<div>...</div>      # 表示框架\n<p>...</p>          # 表示段落\n<li>...</li>        # 表示列表\n<img>...</img>      # 表示图片\n<h1>...</h1>        # 表示标题\n<a href=\"\">...</a>  # 表示超链接\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"574cdf03-482b-30f6-953e-70167a3e8764","title":"","title_html":"","text":"标签里面一般就是我们爬虫想要获取的内容，但真实爬取数据时这些不同的标签对我们来说都是一个字符串而已，并没有多大区别。","text_html":"<p>标签里面一般就是我们爬虫想要获取的内容，但真实爬取数据时这些不同的标签对我们来说都是一个字符串而已，并没有多大区别。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下列哪一个选项不属于 HTML 的标签？","question_text_html":"<p>下列哪一个选项不属于 HTML 的标签？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":10344,"key":"A","text":"[div]...[/div]","text_html":"<p>[div]...[/div]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10345,"key":"B","text":"<html>...</html>","text_html":"<html>...</html>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10346,"key":"C","text":"<p>...</p>","text_html":"<p>...</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10347,"key":"D","text":"<li>...</li>","text_html":"<li>...</li>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10348,"key":"E","text":"<img>...</img>","text_html":"<p><img>...</img></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"63868443-99ff-309c-b8eb-152450928f6e","title":"CSS样式","question_id":2936,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"question_id":2936,"title":"CSS样式","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0d1f6110-d95c-30c3-819c-8ce37fc3306b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"CSS 表示样式，如代码中`<style type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">` 表示将在下面引用一个 CSS，并在 CSS 中定义了对应的样式。\n\n因为CSS只是样式，相当于化妆品，我们爬虫关注的是核心数据，一般不关心网页的CSS，所以此部分简短介绍。","text_html":"<p>CSS 表示样式，如代码中<code>&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot; media=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;</code> 表示将在下面引用一个 CSS，并在 CSS 中定义了对应的样式。</p>\n<p>因为CSS只是样式，相当于化妆品，我们爬虫关注的是核心数据，一般不关心网页的CSS，所以此部分简短介绍。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下列哪一项标识表示正确的引入css标签？","question_text_html":"<p>下列哪一项标识表示正确的引入css标签？</p>\n","question_options":[{"id":10349,"key":"A","text":"<style type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">","text_html":"<p><code>&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot; media=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10350,"key":"B","text":"<script type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\">","text_html":"<p><code>&lt;script type=&quot;text/css&quot; media=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10351,"key":"C","text":"<style type=\"text/cas\" media=\"screen\">","text_html":"<p><code>&lt;style type=&quot;text/cas&quot; media=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":10352,"key":"D","text":"<a type=\"text/JavaScript\" media=\"screen\">","text_html":"<p><code>&lt;a type=&quot;text/JavaScript&quot; media=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;</code></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}},{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"edfed4ac-3372-3299-bdd9-555606bf8249","title":"JavaScript脚本","question_id":2937,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"question_id":2937,"title":"JavaScript脚本","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c9bac590-f56a-3043-846d-3d1387a96399","title":"","title_html":"","text":"JavaScript 表示功能脚本。交互的内容和各种特效都在 JavaScript 中，JavaScript 描述了网站中的各种功能。\n\n如果把网页比喻为人体，那么 HTML 是人的骨架，并且定义了人的嘴巴、眼睛、耳朵等要长在哪里；CSS 表示人的外观细节，如嘴巴长什么样子，眼睛是双眼皮还是单眼皮，是大眼睛还是小眼睛，皮肤是黑色的还是白色的等；JavaScript 表示人的技能，如跳舞、唱歌或演奏乐器等。\n\n至此，我们基本知道了一个网页的核心结构，理论上我们就可以编写一个网页了。\n\n可以在你本地电脑上随便新建一个文件`test.html`，并写入下面的内容:","text_html":"<p>JavaScript 表示功能脚本。交互的内容和各种特效都在 JavaScript 中，JavaScript 描述了网站中的各种功能。</p>\n<p>如果把网页比喻为人体，那么 HTML 是人的骨架，并且定义了人的嘴巴、眼睛、耳朵等要长在哪里；CSS 表示人的外观细节，如嘴巴长什么样子，眼睛是双眼皮还是单眼皮，是大眼睛还是小眼睛，皮肤是黑色的还是白色的等；JavaScript 表示人的技能，如跳舞、唱歌或演奏乐器等。</p>\n<p>至此，我们基本知道了一个网页的核心结构，理论上我们就可以编写一个网页了。</p>\n<p>可以在你本地电脑上随便新建一个文件<code>test.html</code>，并写入下面的内容:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"26571552-8659-3c9a-ab4c-5ab3d05ef684","title":"","caption":"","language":"html","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"<html>\n    <head>\n        <title>python爬虫学习</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <div>python 爬虫学习开始啦</div>\n        <div>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"http://wwww.pythontip.com\">pythontip官网</li>\n                <li>爬虫小试牛刀</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2ec30b0b-4336-332c-99a2-0468b21bcf1d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"然后将该文件直接拖拽到chrome浏览器(其他浏览器可能会出现乱码)，会发现浏览器展示如下:\n![](/content/assets/f371bdccfe454a91bdaa.png)\n\n完整操作视频如下:<br>\n<video src=\"/content/assets/985af86792ee03d976af.mp4\"   controls=\"controls\"></video> \n\n**Good Job!** <br>\n\n我们已经知道了网页的基本标签结构并且也能写简单的网页了，对于爬虫抓取网页所需要了解网页的知识基本足矣。\n\n接下来，我们就正式进入爬虫最核心的内容：**网页下载**、**网页内容解析**。","text_html":"<p>然后将该文件直接拖拽到chrome浏览器(其他浏览器可能会出现乱码)，会发现浏览器展示如下:\n<img src=\"/content/assets/f371bdccfe454a91bdaa.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>完整操作视频如下:<br>\n<video src=\"/content/assets/985af86792ee03d976af.mp4\"   controls=\"controls\"></video></p>\n<p><strong>Good Job!</strong> <br></p>\n<p>我们已经知道了网页的基本标签结构并且也能写简单的网页了，对于爬虫抓取网页所需要了解网页的知识基本足矣。</p>\n<p>接下来，我们就正式进入爬虫最核心的内容：<strong>网页下载</strong>、<strong>网页内容解析</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}],"question_type":"multi_type_in","question_text":"我们内置了一个[爬虫学习欢迎](http://api.pythontip.com/course/hello_html)网页，浏览器打开展示如下:\n![](/content/assets/092b5a8fd988c6c75643.png)\n\n代码右边中输出该网页的源码，请修改`<title>`标签里面内容，变为`python`，然后输出修改后的内容。\n\n> 注意: 只须修改`title`标签，其他请勿修改，否则可能因为空格、换行之类的判题失败。\n\n```html_typein\n<html>\n    <head>\n        <title>__0__</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <div>python 爬虫学习开始啦</div>\n        <div>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"http://wwww.pythontip.com\">pythontip官网</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"http://wwww.baidu.com\">爬虫小试牛刀</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n```","question_text_html":"<p>我们内置了一个<a href=\"http://api.pythontip.com/course/hello_html\">爬虫学习欢迎</a>网页，浏览器打开展示如下:\n<img src=\"/content/assets/092b5a8fd988c6c75643.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>代码右边中输出该网页的源码，请修改<code>&lt;title&gt;</code>标签里面内容，变为<code>python</code>，然后输出修改后的内容。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意: 只须修改<code>title</code>标签，其他请勿修改，否则可能因为空格、换行之类的判题失败。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html_typein\">&lt;html&gt;\n    &lt;head&gt;\n        &lt;title&gt;{0}&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;/head&gt;\n    &lt;body&gt;\n        &lt;div&gt;python 爬虫学习开始啦&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div&gt;\n            &lt;ul&gt;\n                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wwww.pythontip.com&quot;&gt;pythontip官网&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wwww.baidu.com&quot;&gt;爬虫小试牛刀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n            &lt;/ul&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"id":10353,"key":"A","text":"python","text_html":"<p>python</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false,"match_number":1,"max_length":9,"properties":{"prefix":"","postfix":""}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"024","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/024/page/1325"}
